Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.98,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 58\N{\fs30}Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimera's Shadow Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Esoteric technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hollow Wicker Basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hollow Wicker Basket is the origin of\Nthe new Shadow Style's Simple Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It possesses the ability to neutralize a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,domain and counter its\Nguaranteed hit factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't end well for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The domain amplification\Nused by Jogo and Hanami
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in Shibuya used a domain\Ncapable of guaranteed hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guaranteed kill technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he able to hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they intentionally left a\Nspace in their curse technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that Gojo's cursed\Ntechnique could flow into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neutralizing is limitless. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hollow Wicker Basket\Nand Simple Domain aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,capable of neutralizing the\Ncurse technique. So instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they work by neutralizing the barrier\Nthat's imbued with curse technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this way, the imbued technique's\Nguaranteed hit effect is nullified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Fushiguro's domain is incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that wiped the sneer off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.70,0:01:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he transposed his domain\Nonto the space of the gymnasium,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an unexpected consequence happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.66,0:01:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It forced his domain to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not imbued with a\Nguaranteed hit technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.10,0:01:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting like you've already won!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimera Shadow Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is currently extending Fushiguro's\NTen Shadows technique, and as it does so,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,draws out 120 % of his latent potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for Choso, that very\Nimperfection is what caught him off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both his clones and his Shikigami had\Nphysical forms before striking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means this build isn't imbued\Nwith a guaranteed-hit technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The domain's buff to his technique's\Nabilities is no joke, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is even worse to deal with\Nthan a simple guaranteed hit domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he pulls that elephant out\Nhere and drenches me in water,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll take away half of my\Noptions, and I'll probably lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, you know, it's so like me\Nto make sure that won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have it figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had to reinforce my footing with\Ncursed energy to avoid getting sucked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the whole bottom of this\Ndomain is your shadow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're able to remove and\Nstore objects and yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one thing kept nagging at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't this guy have\Nmore weapons he can use?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.64,0:03:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just use that one paltry\Ncurse tool over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a low-capacity tool and\Nyou're trying to reserve as much
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,space for yourself just in case\Nyou need it for something later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or you're being forced\Nto bear the weight of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the objects that are\Nstored in your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the latter was spot-hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've turned the design\Nof your domain against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With three passenger cars, your current\Nweight is approximately 2.4 tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your clones\Nweren't able to tolerate it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet you can't even\Nproduce your Shikigami now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'll just need to keep\Nminding my footing around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I keep adding weight until\Nyou're crushed under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's incomplete, a\Ndomain is still a domain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shadow is everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of us will get crushed first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horanji!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.52,0:04:41.20,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H0200E9&\3c&H000000&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.51,0:05:08.72,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,650)\c&H2E2C2C&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs12\c&HF3F3F3&\bord0\alpha&HFF&\t(237,736,1\alpha&H00&)}The Culling Game Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering why this\Nwith force T pergi Thenhome
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T love me, love me, willbble
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is said that a typical human will\Nlose consciousness at 5 to 6 Gs,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2.4 tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Fushiguro weighed\Nonly 60 kilograms,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that meant he was currently\Nsuffering the equivalent of 40 G's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to prevent his blood\Nfrom pooling in his legs
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the high G's and depriving\Nhis brain of blood flow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro was lowering his posture and\Nreinforcing his body with cursed energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,paying special attention to his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mature African elephant\Nweighs three to six tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the domain's improvement\Nto his technique's accuracy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Max Elephant accurately\Nrecreated its real weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under that weight, Registar's right\Nfibula and heel bone were cracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of them were now under\Nenormous strain and faced
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the possibility of being\Ncrushed to death at any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have won if I had\Nkept the trucks in reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got splashed with some water at the\Nsame time but my trump card's still safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could slip into his shadow and\Nrecreate my trump card inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would crush him for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not dismissing his domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when he does decide to\Ndismiss it, it means anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still in his shadow is\Ngoing to be stuck inside there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I'm stuck in his shadow forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there even after he dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it like inside his shadow anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if I can't breathe in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I float? Keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submerging into his shadow is too risky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Wild's stuck in this state!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to pull out my\Ntrump card and activate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,CONTRACTUAL RECREATION!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.96,0:08:05.25,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(518.667,149.333)\c&H000000&\3c&HE1E6EA&\fnComic Sans MS\b1}Snap
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I know there's no\Noxygen inside of his shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No buoyancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No resistance, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My consciousness...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is... fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep enduring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait until I'm sure he's\Ndead, before dismissing the Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can expel whatever's in my shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The things I recreate,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they disappear soon after carrying out\Nwhatever command I gave them to carry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I didn't give those\Ncars I sank any command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I didn't want\Nthem disappearing on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I could still issue\Nthem a command if I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like, take me and rise up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weight of one car is gone now, but\Nit was totally worth it to save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell you what!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am man enough to admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not as strong as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contractual recreation!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A 132-square-foot, two-story\Nwooden frame structure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The framework alone\Nweighs at least 30 tons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm commanding it to crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened? Did I fall\Nback into his shadow again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No I'm in actual water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How it's heavy what's that\NBrett trying to do strangle me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is from the weight of\Nthose two cars that I added.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, I'm really sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to dismiss contractual recreation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.42,0:11:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The community gymnasium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the gym's basement\Nis a heated swimming pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he go hiding in a shadow\Nand dismiss his domain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could have forced me to destroy\Nthe floor and plunge into the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't use your receipts\Nwhen they're that wet, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He waited instead of pursuing me right\Naway does that mean his technique
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still needs to recover after his domain\Nexhausted it that's what you think
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you sure i'm sure that you\Ncan't produce your shikigami in your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,current condition yeah that's true so\Nyou do understand And what comes next,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to use a\NShikigami, just not that dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But none of his other ones\Ncan deal a decisive blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment you let up, I'll\Nfinish you with a counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought demon dog\Nwas some weak shikigami?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These sorcerers are all liars.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.23,0:13:55.01,Eyecatch_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1700,0)\3c&HC9CBC6&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.69,0:14:00.03,Eyecatch_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\blur2\shad1}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The domain, the pool, all to convince\Nme you couldn't use that dog anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't escape into this\Ngymnasium, you lured me into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think I'd let a modern sorcerer and\Na braddock bat get the better of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nui can't fly that far carrying\Nme, so I couldn't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had trouble with that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how are you connected to Tengen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hermit would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:15:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be history's greatest shut-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reggie said Tengen's claims\Nabout the Call game were a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be smart to consider the possibility\NTengen and Kenjaku are secretly connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that they're both\Nlying about their endgames.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't seem\Nlikely from his reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogane
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transfer all my points\Nover to this little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, you have been\Ngranted 41 points by Registar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in return...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.26,0:15:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must you assume I have some evil plot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to do at least one\Ngood deed before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm just a spectator here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenjaku and I weren't ever close friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I do like this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It certainly makes things interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my intuition anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you did kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The favor is, let fate toy with\Nyou before you die like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have gained five points for a kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, because you dropped your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.06,0:16:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tough Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.41,0:16:57.41,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H73511F&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord0\fs18\pos(398.667,83.333)\fnArial}Slide
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is your whole body covered in lotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might actually be Sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pray it's only Sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've blown him up a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've killed him several times!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how come he has so little damage?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.18,0:17:18.68,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(425,500)\pos(61,92)\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HEDE4E8&}So little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even his giant head wound has healed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he hasn't shown any signs of using\Nreverse curse techniques like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get what's going on with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Player Hazenoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I regret to inform you that\NSatoru Gojo has just died. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, take a bath\Nand brush your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about giving me your points?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:17:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think of it as paying it forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takaba's cursed technique, Comedian,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,takes whatever he's convinced would\Nbe funny and turns it into a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Satoru Gojo is incapable\Nof opposing this technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet Takaba is utterly clueless\Nas to how his technique works.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I became an adult,\NI hardly understand anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that all men\Nare actually wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's always those wolves who take\Ncare of the confusing stuff for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a win-win situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wolves love being in charge, and\NI love not thinking about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men always want to do stuff\Nfor me because I'm so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wolves will always...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not killing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Events progressed quickly in the Sendai\Ncolony, far outstripping those of Tokyo.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.22,0:20:06.93,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,305)\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0\b1\fs20\1a&H22&}Sendai City, Miyagi Prefecture, November 12th, 11:28
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They also started to\Nbecome increasingly fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drew Vlactawala.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Current points, 91.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is his second incarnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an old man who\Nsingle-handedly conquered
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this archipelago during\Nthe Civil War of Wa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He possesses two autonomous Shikigami,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the orbit of those\NShikigami determines his domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ryu Ishigori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Current points, 77.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has the greatest\Ncursed energy firepower
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.68,0:20:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,among any other remaining\Nplayer in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takako Uro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Current points, 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was originally the captain of\Nthe Sun, Moon, and Stars squad,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.68,0:20:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assassins for the Fujiwara clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her technique can manipulate the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kurourushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Current points, 54.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cockroach-cursed spirit that\NKenjaku freed from the control
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.86,0:21:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of cursed spirit manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ranks as a previously\Nregistered special grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,currently lying dormant until\Ncertain conditions are met.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no alliance between them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but their complex\Ncompatibility and opposing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strength led them into\Na four-way stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one of those pillars has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.64,0:21:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuta Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Current points, 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three months after the\Nnight parade of 100 demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he blossomed as a special-grade sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is a modern sorcerer rivaling\Nthe abilities of even Satoru Gojo.
